---

# 46. Security

Never store:

```text
Plain passwords
Plain OTPs
Razorpay secret
JWT secret
Agent token
Database password
```

Never expose:

```text
Linux filesystem paths
MySQL credentials
Agent credentials
Internal service credentials
```

to the mobile application.

