# 48. Final End-to-End Workflow

This is the primary workflow that the implementation must follow.

```text
┌──────────────────────────────┐
│ 1. USER OPENS APP            │
└──────────────┬───────────────┘
               ↓
┌──────────────────────────────┐
│ 2. UPLOAD / SELECT FILE      │
└──────────────┬───────────────┘
               ↓
┌──────────────────────────────┐
│ 3. FASTAPI RECEIVES FILE     │
└──────────────┬───────────────┘
               ↓
┌──────────────────────────────┐
│ 4. VALIDATE FILE             │
└──────────────┬───────────────┘
               ↓
┌──────────────────────────────┐
│ 5. SAVE ORIGINAL FILE        │
│    TO LINUX HDD              │
└──────────────┬───────────────┘
               ↓
┌──────────────────────────────┐
│ 6. SAVE METADATA TO MYSQL    │
└──────────────┬───────────────┘
               ↓
┌──────────────────────────────┐
│ 7. SHOW PRINT OPTIONS        │
└──────────────┬───────────────┘
               ↓
┌──────────────────────────────┐
│ 8. USER SELECTS OPTIONS      │
└──────────────┬───────────────┘
               ↓
┌──────────────────────────────┐
│ 9. BACKEND VALIDATES JOB     │
└──────────────┬───────────────┘
               ↓
          ┌────┴────┐
          │ ACCEPT? │
          └────┬────┘
          NO   │   YES
          │    │
          ▼    ▼
       ERROR  CALCULATE PRICE
                   ↓
          ┌──────────────────┐
          │ 10. RAZORPAY     │
          │     PAYMENT      │
          └────────┬─────────┘
                   ↓
          ┌──────────────────┐
          │ 11. WEBHOOK      │
          │     VERIFIED     │
          └────────┬─────────┘
                   ↓
          ┌──────────────────┐
          │ 12. CREATE JOB   │
          │     IN QUEUE     │
          └────────┬─────────┘
                   ↓
          ┌──────────────────┐
          │ 13. GENERATE OTP │
          └────────┬─────────┘
                   ↓
          ┌──────────────────┐
          │ 14. OTP PAGE     │
          └────────┬─────────┘
                   ↓
          USER ENTERS OTP
                   ↓
          ┌──────────────────┐
          │ 15. FLASK AGENT  │
          │     SENDS OTP    │
          └────────┬─────────┘
                   ↓
          ┌──────────────────┐
          │ 16. FASTAPI      │
          │     VERIFIES OTP │
          └────────┬─────────┘
                   ↓
              ┌────┴────┐
              │ CORRECT?│
              └────┬────┘
              NO   │   YES
              │    │
              ▼    ▼
           REJECT  RELEASE JOB
                       ↓
              ┌──────────────────┐
              │ 17. READ FILE   │
              │     FROM HDD    │
              └────────┬─────────┘
                       ↓
              ┌──────────────────┐
              │ 18. SEND TO CUPS│
              └────────┬─────────┘
                       ↓
              ┌──────────────────┐
              │ 19. PHYSICAL     │
              │     PRINTING     │
              └────────┬─────────┘
                       ↓
              ┌──────────────────┐
              │ 20. COMPLETED    │
              └────────┬─────────┘
                       ↓
              CLEANUP / RETENTION
```

---

# 49. Multi-User Final Workflow

For multiple users:

```text
User A
  ↓
Upload A
  ↓
Options A
  ↓
Accepted
  ↓
Paid
  ↓
Job A / OTP A
```

```text
User B
  ↓
Upload B
  ↓
Options B
  ↓
Accepted
  ↓
Paid
  ↓
Job B / OTP B
```

```text
User C
  ↓
Upload C
  ↓
Options C
  ↓
Accepted
  ↓
Paid
  ↓
Job C / OTP C
```

Backend queue:

```text
┌──────────────┐
│ Job A        │ ← first paid/accepted job
│ OTP A        │
└──────────────┘
       ↓
┌──────────────┐
│ Job B        │
│ OTP B        │
└──────────────┘
       ↓
┌──────────────┐
│ Job C        │
│ OTP C        │
└──────────────┘
```

Every OTP is permanently associated with its own job.

```text
OTP A → Job A → File A
OTP B → Job B → File B
OTP C → Job C → File C
```

The system must never mix:

```text
User A + File B
User B + File C
OTP A + Job B
```

---

# 50. Core Rules

The implementation must always follow these rules:

### Rule 1

```text
Upload first.
```

### Rule 2

```text
Store original file on Linux HDD.
```

### Rule 3

```text
Store only file metadata/storage key in MySQL.
```

### Rule 4

```text
Show print options after successful upload.
```

### Rule 5

```text
Backend validates the complete print job.
```

### Rule 6

```text
Only accepted jobs proceed to payment.
```

### Rule 7

```text
Only backend-calculated amount is used for payment.
```

### Rule 8

```text
Only verified Razorpay payment creates a printable job.
```

### Rule 9

```text
Every paid job gets its own OTP.
```

### Rule 10

```text
OTP belongs to exactly one print job.
```

### Rule 11

```text
OTP verification must be atomic.
```

### Rule 12

```text
Default print queue is FCFS based on successfully paid/queued jobs.
```

### Rule 13

```text
The Flask agent cannot independently decide what to print.
```

### Rule 14

```text
FastAPI authorizes the print job.
```

### Rule 15

```text
Flask reads the authorized file from the local Linux HDD.
```

### Rule 16

```text
CUPS controls the physical printer.
```

### Rule 17

```text
Print completion must be reported back to FastAPI.
```

### Rule 18

```text
Files are deleted only after they are no longer required.
```

---

# 51. Final Architecture in One Line

```text
React Native
    → FastAPI
    → Linux HDD + MySQL
    → Job Validation
    → Razorpay
    → Verified Payment
    → FCFS Print Queue
    → OTP
    → OTP-to-Job Verification
    → Flask Agent
    → CUPS
    → Printer
    → Completion
    → Cleanup
```

This is the core workflow that all backend, database, and print-agent implementation should follow.
